<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuania 104-day T-bill yield 14.13 pct.</title>
<headline>Lithuania 104-day T-bill yield 14.13 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield at an auction of 104-day Treasury bills was 14.13 percent on Tuesday, compared with 13.63 percent at yesterday's sale of 85-day paper, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Amounts are in millions of litas unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p> MATURITY  AV YIELD  (LAST TIME)  MIN/MAX    ISSUE  BID   SOLD</p>
<p> 104-day     14.13     13.63    13.25/14.85   45    71.06  45</p>
<p>Settlement date for today's auction is September 27 and the bils mature on January 9 next year.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 7 22 66 93</p>
</text>
